@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080


### Product detail

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/products/1
Accept: application/json


### Store detail

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/stores/1
Accept: application/json


### Missing product

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/products/999999
Accept: application/json


### Missing store

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/stores/999999
Accept: application/json


### Invalid product ID

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/products/0
Accept: application/json


### Invalid store ID

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/public/stores/-1
Accept: application/json